{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require multilingual 'drive on the left' reminders in all hired vehicles",
        "additional_details": "Too many accidents and fatalities are caused by forgetting or not understanding that we drive on the left. Information in hired vehicles could help to prevent potential accidents. It should be compulsory and in different languages",
        "background": "We believe numerous head on accidents could possibly be prevented if clear signage (in the form of a sticker in different languages) were placed on the steering wheel or dashboard of all hired vehicles. Tourists can get confused. We believe there are not enough signs.",
